$("fileInput").addEventListener("change",async e=>{let f=e.target.files[0];if(!f)return;try{let rows;if(f.name.toLowerCase().endsWith(".csv")){let txt=await f.text();rows=parseCSV(txt)}else{if(!window.XLSX)throw Error("Excel reader library unavailable; save the sheet as CSV and retry.");let wb=XLSX.read(await f.arrayBuffer(),{type:"array"});rows=XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json(wb.Sheets[wb.SheetNames[0]],{defval:""})}loadImportedRows(rows)}catch(err){$("importMsg").textContent="Import error: "+err.message}});
function parseCSV(text){let lines=text.trim().split(/\r?\n/);if(!lines.length)return[];let parse=line=>{let a=[],cur="",q=false;for(let i=0;i<line.length;i++){let c=line[i];if(c==='"'&&line[i+1]==='"'&&q){cur+='"';i++}else if(c==='"')q=!q;else if(c===","&&!q){a.push(cur);cur=""}else cur+=c}a.push(cur);return a};let h=parse(lines[0]).map(s=>s.trim());return lines.slice(1).map(l=>Object.fromEntries(parse(l).map((v,i)=>[h[i],v.trim()])))}
function download(name,text,type="text/csv"){let blob=new Blob([text],{type});let url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement("a");a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url)}
